	"Description": "[center][img]https://i.imgur.com/G0hAPOC.png[/img]\n<br />A new batch of popular Indian livestock and fowl! the CP replacements are\n<br />White chicken to Asil chicken\n<br />Brown chicken to Guinea Fowl\n<br />Blue chicken to \uFEFFWhite-Faced Black Spanish chicken\n<br />Void chicken to Kadaknath chicken\n<br />Ducks to Indian Runner ducks\n<br />Goats to Jamnapari goats\n<br />Pigs to Indian boars\n<br />White cows to black Dangi\n<br />Brown cows to brown dangi\n<br />\n<br />or you can use the BFAV version for standalones! The chickens and duck all lay regular eggs, cows and goat produce milk, the guinea fowl will bring you bug meat and the boars find omni geodes.\n<br />\n<br />All have baby versions![/center]",
